        <mxCell id="n" value="A state file belongs to you: Galimatron does not read it. Your xslt reads the file the last run left, decides what is new, and writes the file again. Put the files in a folder that gal.cfg names, and keep the folder under version control with your .gal files." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
